WEBVTT

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:20.553
Haj/mete no kimochi
Shonbori no mune ni

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:29.325
Polio nagerareta hidamari ne

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:40.573
Hitori aruiteta Sara miageta toki

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:48.815
Haru ga soko ni kiteta Misetekureta

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:58.816
K ogareru omoi wa
maichiru hanabira ne

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:08.902
Suki ni natteiino sore-lama

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:19.176
Tamerau kokoro ga
brake kakerukedo

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:33.955
Kurushikutte iki ga tomarisou desu

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.126
/ want her.

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:49.299
/ want to touch her
and hold her tight.

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:51.440
/ want to be close to her.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:56.009
Th is isn ’1 right.
I’m such a dirty person.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.550
No!

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:11.155
Winter Moon

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.167
/ would never want to hurt her.

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:43.227
Good morning.

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:44.929
Morning.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.234
Is she still sleeping?

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.567
Nanoka?
She already left.

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:55.264
She said she had to
leave early this morning.

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.372
Oh, really.

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.176
Okay, let’s eat.

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:09.778
You don ’1 even give me
the chance to apologize.

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:14.758
Well, i think it doesn ’1 make
any differen ce no w.

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:20.830
if i just disappear,
everything will be better.

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.577
Don ’t say such a thing.

00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:41.216
it’s not right for us to say that.

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:45.082
You know we are brother and sister,
so of course we love each other.

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:48.149
lthink you ’re just weird.

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:54.155
He said l’m weird.
i know that already.

00:04:05.712 --> 00:04:08.078
i went too far.

00:04:09.215 --> 00:04:11.050
lshou/dn ’t have asked him...

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:14.611
a thing like
“how do you feel about me?”

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:23.594
But, why? Why did you do
that to me, big brother?

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:40.844
Moving out?

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:42.342
Why?

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:45.585
I really envied you.

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:49.146
Being a middle aged guy, still living
at your parent’s home for free.

00:04:49.589 --> 00:04:50.578
Ijust wanted to.

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:57.627
Do you realize how busy our
company is during this time of year?

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:01.834
The Christmas party, End of
the year party, New Years party...

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:04.337
and soon after those, we’ll be
doing the Valentine’s Day party.

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:06.639
We are going into party-hell soon.

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:08.470
Are you serious about
moving out tomorrow?

00:05:09.342 --> 00:05:10.969
l have my reasons.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.340
Well, did you already find a place?

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:14.747
Not yet.

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:15.982
Do you have any place in mind?

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:16.744
No.

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.918
What are you going to do?

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:19.748
I don’t know.

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:25.591
Then, why don’t you
decide right now?

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:28.161
We don’t have to be
in the office today.

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:29.093
Hey, wait a minute!

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:37.136
How’s this place?

00:05:37.136 --> 00:05:42.267
I think it has everything you need.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:43.440
I see.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.612
This place seems nice.
Why don’t you decide already?

00:05:46.612 --> 00:05:48.204
It’s close to the train station...

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:50.950
and I saw a
convenience store nearby.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.719
So, it’s easy for you to go shopping.

00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:55.488
And it’s even closer to
the office than my place.

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:57.957
I like it.
I think it’s very convenient.

00:05:57.957 --> 00:06:00.721
Why do I have to pick a place
that suits your needs?

00:06:01.094 --> 00:06:02.729
Can he move in tomorrow?

00:06:02.729 --> 00:06:06.099
Yes, as long as you could make the
deposit and sign the contract now...

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:08.465
I’ll talk to the landlord.

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:10.236
So, what kind of contract is it?

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:12.538
Can you fill out the contract now?

00:06:12.538 --> 00:06:15.408
You can bring a guarantor’s
signature tomorrow.

00:06:15.408 --> 00:06:17.808
I can give you the name
of a good moving company...

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:35.087
I thought you’d already gone home.

00:06:39.599 --> 00:06:41.965
Why do you look so serious?

00:06:43.603 --> 00:06:45.332
I don’t look serious.

00:06:45.605 --> 00:06:47.698
But you’re smiling that fake smile.

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:49.336
Did something happen to you?

00:06:49.776 --> 00:06:51.544
You’ve been looking upset
since this morning.

00:06:51.544 --> 00:06:52.533
I’m fine.

00:06:55.882 --> 00:06:59.181
Ijust don’tfeel like
going home now.

00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:03.077
That doesn’t sound good at all.

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:12.430
ANZAI

00:07:13.032 --> 00:07:14.590
You can play games
as much as you want!

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:16.533
Listen to CD’s as much as you want!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.028
Eat snacks as much as you like!

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:22.036
And you can chat with me
as long as you want!

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:25.772
So, why don’t you cheer up?

00:07:27.613 --> 00:07:28.545
Yes.

00:07:32.418 --> 00:07:35.251
Oh, Nanoka, how are you?

00:07:35.788 --> 00:07:36.777
Hello.

00:07:38.724 --> 00:07:41.627
What?
Why is this room so messy?

00:07:41.627 --> 00:07:43.857
Hey! Why don’t you clean up?

00:07:43.996 --> 00:07:47.400
Shut up! I know it.
Just leave us alone, big sister.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.800
You’ll never clean up
unless ltell you.

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:53.072
Hey, I have important things
to talk about with Nanoka.

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:56.742
It’s kind of complicated and
you’d never understand.

00:07:56.742 --> 00:07:58.478
Oh, by the way...

00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:01.013
can you return the blue shirt
that you borrowed form me?

00:08:01.013 --> 00:08:03.015
What?!
I thought you gave it to me.

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:05.685
You said you weren’t
going to wear it anymore.

00:08:05.685 --> 00:08:08.120
Ijust changed my mind now.
Give it back.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.554
That’s notfair!
Indian giver!

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:17.418
Are you sure?

00:08:17.864 --> 00:08:22.358
Well, since you’re moving
tomorrow, you have to go pack.

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:26.599
Thanks.
I’ll make it up next time.

00:08:27.306 --> 00:08:30.605
So, what happened?

00:08:33.613 --> 00:08:35.103
Nothing happened.

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:38.451
Then why do you have to sneak away
from your house at night?

00:08:38.451 --> 00:08:40.820
Don’t say it like
I did something wrong.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.720
But you’re trying to run away.

00:08:45.658 --> 00:08:47.717
It might seem like it.

00:08:51.797 --> 00:08:52.786
See you.

00:08:53.432 --> 00:08:54.729
See you.

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:02.239
I don’t get it.

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:14.887
One more time!

00:09:14.887 --> 00:09:16.055
Uh, sure.

00:09:16.055 --> 00:09:17.823
That’s notfair!
Losers have to change places.

00:09:17.823 --> 00:09:19.091
Oh, hey!

00:09:19.091 --> 00:09:20.422
You’re mean!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.594
Oh, all right!
I get it!

00:09:26.766 --> 00:09:32.227
Can you believe that
she’s getting married next year?

00:09:32.505 --> 00:09:34.598
Oh?
Is that really true?

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:39.639
Uh-huh.
She’s right.

00:09:40.079 --> 00:09:41.239
It’s time.

00:09:41.814 --> 00:09:44.248
It’s time to...it’s time to...

00:09:45.017 --> 00:09:46.177
It’s time to...

00:09:48.387 --> 00:09:49.615
pay the property tax!

00:09:51.891 --> 00:09:53.688
Do you guys have boyfriends?

00:09:58.197 --> 00:10:03.760
I guess you guys are at that age
when you love for love’s sake.

00:10:04.136 --> 00:10:06.472
But you’re having
an arranged marriage.

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:08.841
It’s notjust that,
it’s more than just a relationship.

00:10:08.841 --> 00:10:12.402
l have to think of all kinds of other
factors in order to get married.

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:15.982
Aren’t you getting married
because you like that person?

00:10:15.982 --> 00:10:17.506
Of course I like him.

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:21.854
But, you can’tjust maintain
a marriage with love alone.

00:10:21.854 --> 00:10:24.516
There are so many realistic
things that will come up.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:33.232
Butl also ask myself,
“Am I really doing the right thing?”

00:10:33.232 --> 00:10:37.269
You are doing the right thing. Ifeel
much freer if you leave the house.

00:10:37.269 --> 00:10:39.430
All right, I get it.

00:11:23.716 --> 00:11:25.718
Did she call you?

00:11:25.718 --> 00:11:28.020
Um, yeah.

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.955
She said she would be staying
at her friend’s house tonight.

00:11:32.358 --> 00:11:33.290
I see.

00:11:42.001 --> 00:11:42.797
What?

00:11:43.402 --> 00:11:44.232
Well...

00:11:46.639 --> 00:11:47.936
Listen, I...

00:11:53.846 --> 00:11:55.143
I’ll get that.

00:12:01.053 --> 00:12:02.918
Hello, this is the Saeki residence.

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:08.217
Hello.

00:12:10.262 --> 00:12:11.320
Oh, hey.

00:12:12.498 --> 00:12:16.969
The year-end sales
are starting everywhere...

00:12:16.969 --> 00:12:18.061
How are you?

00:12:18.838 --> 00:12:19.566
OK...

00:12:21.273 --> 00:12:24.674
I decided to stay
at Futaba’s house tonight.

00:12:25.878 --> 00:12:28.847
Oh, I heard thatfrom dad just now.

00:12:29.615 --> 00:12:34.917
I told him that I would be
coming home tomorrow morning...

00:12:35.654 --> 00:12:37.957
but it looks like I’m going to be
home a little later than that...

00:12:37.957 --> 00:12:39.515
so I wanted to let him know that.

00:12:39.825 --> 00:12:40.655
I see.

00:12:47.533 --> 00:12:48.363
-We||...
-Well...

00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:51.531
-Uh, what?
-Oh, sorry...

00:12:58.944 --> 00:13:00.002
Big brother...

00:13:03.382 --> 00:13:04.849
Aren ’t you angry?

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:07.111
About what?

00:13:08.754 --> 00:13:10.356
Because I asked you
what you thought of me.

00:13:10.356 --> 00:13:11.550
We’re going to eat now.

00:13:12.224 --> 00:13:13.020
Okay.

00:13:18.197 --> 00:13:20.833
I asked you such a weird thing.

00:13:20.833 --> 00:13:22.960
Real/y?

00:13:23.435 --> 00:13:29.772
Yes. You said I was weird.

00:13:30.042 --> 00:13:32.738
I’d never think that.

00:13:33.412 --> 00:13:34.242
But...

00:13:35.214 --> 00:13:38.843
You are not weird,
and I’m not angry.

00:13:39.118 --> 00:13:40.210
Really?

00:13:41.687 --> 00:13:43.814
Oh, by the way...

00:13:46.792 --> 00:13:50.250
I’m sorry that I did things like that.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.664
I’m really sorry.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.396
I wasn’t offended by it.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:58.828
But...

00:14:00.005 --> 00:14:03.133
Actually, I was a little offended.

00:14:04.076 --> 00:14:05.304
l’m sorry.

00:14:05.644 --> 00:14:08.272
But, it’s not really
bothering me so much.

00:14:09.181 --> 00:14:10.011
i see.

00:14:11.784 --> 00:14:12.842
That’s a relief.

00:14:13.986 --> 00:14:17.854
Ifeel relieved too,
because I got to talk to you.

00:14:18.057 --> 00:14:21.288
Oh, you know, I...

00:14:21.527 --> 00:14:22.221
What?

00:14:25.164 --> 00:14:27.291
Oh, it’s nothing.

00:14:28.033 --> 00:14:28.965
What?

00:14:29.735 --> 00:14:31.403
Don ’t worry. it’s nothing.

00:14:31.403 --> 00:14:32.631
It’s making me worry.

00:14:33.038 --> 00:14:34.835
it’s just nothing.

00:14:36.809 --> 00:14:38.037
Big brother...

00:14:41.046 --> 00:14:42.138
lthink...

00:14:43.182 --> 00:14:45.207
lmight go home tonight.

00:14:47.486 --> 00:14:49.579
Why are you saying that?!
I’m hanging up now.

00:14:50.055 --> 00:14:50.817
Okay.

00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:52.489
Good night.

00:14:53.792 --> 00:14:54.588
Okay.

00:15:11.043 --> 00:15:13.034
Hey, we’re going to
eat up everything.

00:15:14.179 --> 00:15:15.009
Alright.

00:15:16.615 --> 00:15:18.549
Big sister!
You’re eating too much.

00:15:18.851 --> 00:15:21.319
What’s wrong with that?
I made it.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.023
You won’t be able to wear
your wedding dress anymore.

00:15:24.023 --> 00:15:25.581
Yes, I can.

00:15:25.858 --> 00:15:28.260
You know what they say, ‘a moment
on your lips, lifetime on your hips’!

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.591
You too!

00:15:30.829 --> 00:15:31.761
Nanoka?

00:15:33.799 --> 00:15:36.029
What’s wrong?
You don’tfeel like eating?

00:15:36.602 --> 00:15:38.070
Does it look bad?

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.560
What did you say?

00:15:40.039 --> 00:15:41.768
No, not at all.

00:15:41.974 --> 00:15:44.209
Hey, why don’t you eat?
It’s delicious.

00:15:44.209 --> 00:15:46.645
That’s right. Hey, Futaba,
why don’t you putthem on her plate?

00:15:46.645 --> 00:15:48.545
lam!

00:16:01.827 --> 00:16:03.963
I know what you are saying but...

00:16:03.963 --> 00:16:07.800
I’m not saying it’s a bad idea
to start living on your own, but...

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.135
I know I’m saying this all of sudden.

00:16:10.135 --> 00:16:13.263
I’m sorry that I decided this
by myself so quickly.

00:16:13.405 --> 00:16:15.965
What don’t you like
about living here?

00:16:20.512 --> 00:16:22.281
There is nothing I don’t like.

00:16:22.281 --> 00:16:23.949
That can’t be true.

00:16:23.949 --> 00:16:27.749
Then why did you suddenly
decide to leave the house?

00:16:28.687 --> 00:16:31.212
l have been thinking about it
for a long time.

00:16:31.924 --> 00:16:35.361
What was it?
Why don’t you be honest and tell me?

00:16:35.361 --> 00:16:37.629
Do you have some problem with me?

00:16:37.629 --> 00:16:40.257
Or, has something happened
between you and Nanoka?

00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:42.759
Nothing...

00:16:47.039 --> 00:16:48.529
Why did you come back?

00:16:51.844 --> 00:16:54.836
ljustfelt like coming home.

00:16:55.981 --> 00:16:57.448
So, I came home.

00:17:01.253 --> 00:17:04.154
What do you mean you’re leaving?

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:14.795
Here.

00:17:18.137 --> 00:17:19.331
Thank you.

00:17:42.361 --> 00:17:43.191
Okay.

00:17:51.003 --> 00:17:52.061
What’s the matter?

00:18:01.013 --> 00:18:03.573
Can I sleep with you tonight?

00:18:05.884 --> 00:18:09.047
ljust wanted to be with you
at least tonight.

00:18:12.825 --> 00:18:15.089
Hey, wait a second.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.704
I guess I’m weird.

00:18:32.778 --> 00:18:37.215
We’re brother and sister,
but I’m acting strange like this.

00:18:37.983 --> 00:18:39.974
You’re not weird.

00:18:42.087 --> 00:18:45.579
I guess a brother and sister
can do this sometimes.

00:18:47.359 --> 00:18:48.587
As long as they really act
like a brother and a sister.

00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:53.890
Then why are you leaving?

00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:55.801
You must already know why.

00:18:55.801 --> 00:18:56.825
I don’t know why.

00:18:57.503 --> 00:18:58.902
lthink you do.

00:19:03.609 --> 00:19:04.837
Let’s make a promise.

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:08.575
This is the last time, and
we’ll never see each other again.

00:19:09.681 --> 00:19:10.773
Why?

00:19:12.351 --> 00:19:13.978
Why are you saying that?

00:19:15.687 --> 00:19:18.121
It’s not right.
What do you mean “the last time”?

00:19:21.894 --> 00:19:24.192
You’re not even going that far.

00:19:26.331 --> 00:19:28.094
Why does it have to be like this?

00:19:29.668 --> 00:19:31.033
We’re just brother and sister.

00:19:32.471 --> 00:19:36.168
Yes, we are brother and sister.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.280
You know what?

00:19:53.659 --> 00:19:56.719
There is something that
I couldn’t tell you for a long time.

00:19:58.697 --> 00:20:02.030
Do you remember when
we rode on the Ferris wheel?

00:20:04.136 --> 00:20:06.934
I didn’t know why
I felt that way, but...

00:20:08.006 --> 00:20:09.132
to tell you the truth...

00:20:10.275 --> 00:20:13.802
I felt very happy at the time.

00:20:21.253 --> 00:20:25.246
So, if ljust let my feelings grow, I...

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:58.845
Yasashiiyume ga
sotto mune no haru o yobi

00:21:59.484 --> 00:22:09.621
Yasashii kaze ni nari
kimi ni furete satte yuku

00:22:10.729 --> 00:22:17.965
Chiisana pot niwa
daisukina kimochiyurayura to

00:22:18.804 --> 00:22:23.675
li kaori nosete itsumo matteita

00:22:23.675 --> 00:22:30.877
Kono toki o atatamete

00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:42.685
Futari dakara wakaru koto
kotobajyanakute

00:22:43.695 --> 00:22:49.101
Hohoemu dake negau dake

00:22:49.101 --> 00:22:53.800
Shizukana sora e

00:22:54.806 --> 00:23:00.972
Ashita mo mata aeruyone

00:23:02.381 --> 00:23:08.718
Shizukana sora de

00:23:15.327 --> 00:23:17.056
